<p>This is how reality altering people should be written. It is well-written enough that I upvoted it, with special points for characterization, for the Foundation able to at least appear &quot;nice&quot; when it suits them (too many people have the Foudnation as lol-Evil, even when its against their interests to be), for doing it with a difficult subject, and having it all believable in-universe.</p>
